# Line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF, also on
# Windows (core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check the scripts out with CRLF,
# and a package built from such a tree carries the \r to the router).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: images, audio test vectors, packages and archives.
*.png binary
*.g722 binary
*.raw binary
*.ipk binary
*.gz binary
